1
00:00:00,445 --> 00:00:02,115
Hello to you too.

2
00:00:02,613 --> 00:00:03,943
(Leonard:)How was rock climbing?

3
00:00:04,115 --> 00:00:05,495
(Kripke:)He passed out.

4
00:00:05,658 --> 00:00:07,998
Just hung there like a big salami.

5
00:00:09,746 --> 00:00:11,376
Eh, eh, eh. That's where I sit.

6
00:00:11,539 --> 00:00:14,629
(Kripke:)Ooh, you have a special spot.
What kind of wacko are you?

7
00:00:15,585 --> 00:00:17,835
(Howard:)How much time you got?

8
00:00:19,005 --> 00:00:20,635
You want some Chinese food?

9
00:00:20,798 --> 00:00:22,968
Terrific. Got any dental floss?

10
00:00:23,593 --> 00:00:24,803
(Leonard:)In the bathroom.

11
00:00:24,969 --> 00:00:26,299
(Kripke:)Be right back.

12
00:00:26,471 --> 00:00:30,851
I gotta floss the lndian food out of my teeth
if I'm gonna eat Chinese.

13
00:00:32,268 --> 00:00:33,648
(Penny:)Sheldon, are you okay?

14
00:00:33,811 --> 00:00:37,021
(Sheldon:)Oh, yes. I pass out all the time.

15
00:00:37,190 --> 00:00:40,980
(Sheldon:)But it was worth it. I've made substantial
progress in bonding with Kripke...

16
00:00:41,152 --> 00:00:43,652
(Sheldon:)...which brings me
to an awkward moment.

17
00:00:43,821 --> 00:00:46,661
- What's that?
- Maintaining five friendships...

18
00:00:46,824 --> 00:00:50,164
(Sheldon:)...promises to be a Herculean task.

19
00:00:50,328 --> 00:00:52,708
(Sheldon:)So I'm going to have
to let one of you go.

20
00:00:55,166 --> 00:00:59,026
(Howard:)Me, me, let it be me.

